# Day 01 Resources

## Topics to Study

- Cybersecurity fundamentals
- CIA Triad
- Cybersecurity threats
- Malware
- Phishing
- Firewalls
- Authentication
- Access control
- Basic security principles

## Tools to Explore

- Nmap
- Linux
- Git
- GitHub

## Practice

Research one real-world cybersecurity attack and document:

1. Attack name
2. Attack type
3. Target
4. How the attack happened
5. Impact
6. Prevention methods
